:"opus","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-bp.1","bob-cli-bp.2","bob-cli-bp.3","bob-cli-bp.4","bob-cli-bp.5","bob-cli-bp.6"]},"source_run_id":"run-6e4840914bf8a13022f0b0d5a755dff5","started_at":"2026-10-24T22:35:08.267299+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1792875075,"sha":"0fc6ebfaccaca03e00dab4f0ee6552db2c92834c","subject":"fix(stats): mark unmet provisional booleans not yet"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"54a140b04ce7b291aa229f0276864e5ba765c97c042bb7cb85389e64bb97e777","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1/chat.md","size_bytes":6297},"commits":{"digest":"c8cbef0f5f52e2f876b516c61a343c938a094531d6166744964eb1c3c8f92eee","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1/commits.json","size_bytes":229},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"f0d9bae6ceb518938a8683571e7df93691981a419e9660e653476b6a0dcd1d77","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1/meta.json","size_bytes":6156},"prompt":{"digest":"e892ac511b8da4b2f600151591ddc173c3bb313bff284a4739a76b6710c855ad","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":183},"state":{"digest":"604160fb05503be5d470e44b8adb9eee4161d0b5d2522188597445ce3f0c5ff3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bp.1","local_name":"bob-cli-bp.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-bp","agent_clan_generation":"20261024163144","bead_id":"bob-cli-bp.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-bp[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Day strip — a compact daily-stats receipt at the bottom of Bob [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]daily notes[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every canonical daily note (`YYYY/YYYYMMDD.md`) ends with a quiet, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]beautiful Day strip of that day's own facts (Worked, Reviewed, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Done, Created, Review closed, and the area time mix). It is painted[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from cache in the first frame, re-runs `bob stats` only while it is[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]on screen and the data has changed and aged, and is never written [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]into the note.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]daily_note_day_strip.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/daily_note_day_strip.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-bp[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-bp/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob stats reads \"not yet\" for an unmet provisional boolean[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]stats-not-yet[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats-not-yet: in bob-cli, make an unmet provisional (today) boolean [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]point display `not yet` in JSON, CSV, and human output, and draw `◌` in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the bool sparkline. Then update the unit and CLI tests and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/stats.md display rules and M6 row.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stats fetch service fixes for the Stats page and the strip[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fetch-service[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fetch-service: in bob-plugins' bob-ledger-tools, give each key its own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in-flight promise behind a FIFO queue so no waiter is lost, track change[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generations and fetch ages so cache hits spawn only when dirty, add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache-update listener API, a synchronous peek, and `group`. Also gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Stats page revalidation on visibility and add spawn counters.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip model, painter, styles, and preview matrix[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fetch-service[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-view: add the pure `dayStripModel` and DOM `paintDayStrip`, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`.bob-day-strip` stylesheet, synthetic fixtures, model and painter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and a headless-Chromium preview matrix. Inspect its screenshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]until the strip meets the visual contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip data selection, refresh policy, fence, and Stats [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]hand-off[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-hosts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fetch-service, strip-view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-hosts: add the day-identity and report-selection rules, the strip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry and its visible/dirty/aged refresh policy with rollover, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`bob-day-stats` fence host, and `openStatsForDay`, which opens Stats [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the day pinned. Cover them with fake-timer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fake-IntersectionObserver, and fake-execFile tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Virtual Live Preview mount, controls, and plugin docs[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-mount[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip-hosts[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-mount: mount the strip as a CodeMirror StateField block widget [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after the last line of canonical daily notes in Live Preview. Add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`stats.day_strip` config switch, the session `Toggle Day stats` command,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-device collapse, fence stand-down, and the optional Reading view [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]host. Then update plugin docs and the manifest, and sync to the vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip contract in bob-cli docs and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stats-not-yet, strip-mount[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-docs: document the shipped Day strip in docs/stats.md (what it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shows, honest states, refresh budget, controls, fence) and link it from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/dashboard.md. Write the decision record and glossary term only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]where their memory decisions were accepted.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-bp","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-bp.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8f35997dcc86f355105f53b9a4846ee9","started_at":"2026-10-24T20:37:19.355832+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1792881140,"sha":"41afa14b74ac7fc6bc4b05cd80366acbc3f08511","subject":"docs(stats): document the shipped Day strip contract"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"